    {
      "id": "first-ten-minutes-n-start",
      "type": "content",
      "label": "Start here",
      "position": {
        "x": 3000,
        "y": 0
      },
      "width": 640,
      "height": 430,
      "ports": [
        {
          "id": "root",
          "key": "root",
          "label": "root",
          "direction": "bidirectional",
          "dataType": "any",
          "angle": 270
        }
      ],
      "handles": [
        {
          "id": "root",
          "key": "root",
          "label": "root",
          "direction": "bidirectional",
          "dataType": "any",
          "angle": 270,
          "portId": "root"
        }
      ],
      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": true,
      "data": {
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "first-ten-minutes-declaration",
          "nodeId": "first-ten-minutes-n-start"
        },
        "content": {
          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "### Start here\n\n**What this is.** A draft of a newcomer's first ten minutes, one task for each step, so each can be discussed on its own.\n\n**How to use it.** Read a step, then the open questions. Answer the ones you can; mark the decision as decided if the draft's newcomer is right. The three questions on the left of the second row are for the owner. The four after them are where the right answer is not clear.\n\n**Not yet done.** Nobody has walked through steps 1 to 4 as a first-time user. The \"Today\" notes come from the code and the library."
        },
        "_placement": {
          "version": 1,
          "state": "manually-shaped",
          "source": "manual",
          "updatedAt": 1791502752029,
          "reason": "node-drag"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "first-ten-minutes-n-seen",
      "type": "content",
      "label": "What was observed, and where",
      "position": {
        "x": 3000,
        "y": 470
      },
      "width": 640,
      "height": 430,
      "ports": [
        {
          "id": "root",
          "key": "root",
          "label": "root",
          "direction": "bidirectional",
          "dataType": "any",
          "angle": 270
        }
      ],
      "handles": [
        {
          "id": "root",
          "key": "root",
          "label": "root",
          "direction": "bidirectional",
          "dataType": "any",
          "angle": 270,
          "portId": "root"
        }
      ],
      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": true,
      "data": {
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "first-ten-minutes-declaration",
          "nodeId": "first-ten-minutes-n-seen"
        },
        "content": {
          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "### What was observed, and where\n\n- The entry graph is \"Twilite Zone Root\", with portals to Github, Twilite, Agent, Tutorial, Gallery and a personal library.\n- A new graph begins as the Blank Start: a root, a Detail, a Summary and a Glyph, with plain text in the views.\n- The canon templates are Collection, Declaration, Document Starter, Page, Repo and Task. The Task Template is the one in everyday use.\n- The bootstrap handshake and the LLM onboarding text exist; the handshake is copied from a button in the top bar.\n- A remote change to an open graph appears by itself in about a minute (the hosted endpoint and live reload).\n- The full three-sizes effect needs the paid workspace."
        },
        "_placement": {
          "version": 1,
          "state": "manually-shaped",
          "source": "manual",
          "updatedAt": 1791502752029,
          "reason": "node-drag"
        }
      }
    }
